\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} 2. 重写 Commit Message}
fix(cli): reject whitespace\PYGZhy{}only names with exit code 2
Treat names consisting entirely of whitespace characters as invalid input.
Inspect the stripped argument after parsing; if empty, terminate execution
via sys.exit(2) to prevent printing a greeting for blank names.

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} 3. 重写 Code Review 意见}
\PYG{g+gs}{**[Blocking]**}: 当前实现未对 \PYG{l+s+sb}{`a.name`} 执行空白字符校验。当用户传入纯空格参数时，仍会输出 \PYG{l+s+sb}{`Hello,   !`} 并静默返回 0。该行为不符合参数校验规范。建议在 \PYG{l+s+sb}{`parse\PYGZus{}args()`} 后添加 \PYG{l+s+sb}{`if not a.name.strip(): sys.exit(2)`}，并补充对应的单元测试覆盖纯空白输入场景。
